{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/editor.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "editor.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "summary": "编辑器 tab 体系（与终端/日志 tab 同构）：.note 块笔记走 Editor.js（图片上传、块菜单、全量 UI 汉化），txt/md/代码走 Monaco（.md 带 markdown-it 实时预览分栏），均失败降级 textarea；含脏检测（Notepad++ 风格 * 标记）、原地改名（定名即保存）、右侧大纲（tree-sitter 真语法树优先/正则启发式/井号规则三级）、全局搜索与统一文件打开入口（拖拽/最近/顶栏打开智能分发到编辑器/阅读器/十六进制）。",
      "tags": ["editor", "ui-panel", "file-management", "outline", "search"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "多个「坑注释」级模式：Editor.js i18n 词典必须包在 i18n.messages 内才生效；inline 元素 style.display 设 '' 会回落到 CSS 的 none，需显式 'block'；Monaco getPosition() 返回 lineNumber 而非 line；确认弹窗每次调用重绑 resolve 防旧 Promise settled。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:buildEditorTab",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "buildEditorTab",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [52, 239],
      "summary": "构建编辑器 tab：同名去重切换、.note 的 JSON content 解析（防外部字符串未解析被 Ctrl+S 覆盖成空笔记）、conn 状态对象（editor/monaco/ta 三引擎、脏检测、外部路径 extPath）、工具栏与 Ctrl+S/Ctrl+F 全局快捷键（活动 tab 才处理，「/」开块菜单焦点兜底）、.md 预览分栏绑定。",
      "tags": ["editor", "ui-panel", "event-handler", "factory"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:_edInitContent",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_edInitContent",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [242, 378],
      "summary": "编辑区初始化：.note 建 EditorJS 实例（工具集配置 + i18n.messages 全量汉化 + Quote 对齐 bug 原型补丁 + 图片灯箱）；纯文本按 md/非 md 建 Monaco（onDidChangeModelContent 驱动脏检测与预览），Monaco 失败降级 textarea 保可用。",
      "tags": ["editor", "initialization", "localization", "fallback"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:_edRenderOutline",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_edRenderOutline",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [504, 690],
      "summary": "右侧大纲渲染：纯文本优先 tree-sitter 真语法树（tsOutline，失败显示原因不无声回落），代码文件回落正则启发式（py 缩进/花括号语言函数签名行），md/txt 用 # 井号规则；内容版本短路防重复解析，异步代际守卫防竞态闪烁，json 树大纲支持折叠（状态存 conn 跨渲染保留）；.note 列标题块并统计块类型分布。",
      "tags": ["outline", "tree-sitter", "rendering", "performance"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:edSave",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "edSave",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [737, 754],
      "summary": "保存：未落盘（草稿）先转改名流程定名；已落盘取当前内容（.note 为 JSON、纯文本为字符串），外部文件写回原绝对路径、站内文件按名写 files/，成功后复位脏态并记入最近打开。",
      "tags": ["editor", "persistence", "file-management"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:edRenamePrompt",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "edRenamePrompt",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [771, 840],
      "summary": "tab 标题原地改名（无 prompt 弹窗）：标题 span 换自适应宽度输入框，只显主名不带后缀、提交时自动补回（草稿默认 .note，落盘保留原后缀，用户显式输入后缀则尊重）；草稿定名即 save_as 落盘，已落盘则磁盘重命名；Enter 确认/Esc 取消/失焦确认。",
      "tags": ["editor", "ui-panel", "file-management", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
