      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [927, 974],
      "summary": "files/ 目录文件列表弹窗：新建笔记、资源管理器打开目录、列出文件（图标/时间/大小）点击进编辑器打开。",
      "tags": ["modal", "file-list", "editor"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/editor.js:openEditorFile",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "openEditorFile",
      "filePath": "web/js/editor.js",
      "lineRange": [717, 734],
      "summary": "打开已有文件：files/ 站内按 name、外部文件按绝对路径（Windows 绝对路径/UNC 正则识别）调 /api/ed/open，.note 内容解析为 JSON，记入最近打开后建编辑器 tab（外部路径传 extPath 写回原文件）。",
      "tags": ["file-management", "editor", "api-client"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "hex-viewer.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "summary": "十六进制查看/编辑器（HxD/ImHex 同款布局）：偏移|hex 分组（8/16/32/64 位、hex/十进制、大小端）|ASCII 三栏；≤16MB 整读可编辑（分块循环读满防截断）、超限只读分块窗口加载；数据检视面板多类型解释（整数/IEEE754 浮点/LEB128/RGBA/时间戳，选区优先）；支持 hex/文本搜索、偏移跳转、Intel HEX 解析与回写（含 type 04 扩展地址记录防 64KB 回绕）。",
      "tags": ["hex-viewer", "binary-editor", "inspector", "search", "virtual-list"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "BigInt 贯穿 64 位组值与 LEB128 拼值；Intel HEX 回写超 64KB 镜像必须发 type 04 扩展线性地址记录，否则地址字段回绕导致固件写坏；0x00 灰显偏好存 localStorage。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/hex-viewer.js:buildHexViewerTab",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "buildHexViewerTab",
      "filePath": "web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "lineRange": [14, 336],
      "summary": "构建 hex tab：meta 探测大小与 Intel HEX 标记，可编辑时分块循环读满全部字节（单次 512KB 后端钳制，漏循环会截断文件）、ihex 解析成连续镜像；只读大文件用滚动窗口 ensureWindow 按需取块；绑定选区（单击/Shift/拖选）、键盘 hex 直接改值、查看方式切换、搜索/跳转/保存工具栏与 0x00 灰显联动。",
      "tags": ["hex-viewer", "ui-panel", "event-handler", "virtual-list"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/hex-viewer.js:_hxRenderRows",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_hxRenderRows",
      "filePath": "web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "lineRange": [365, 418],
      "summary": "渲染行区间：按查看方式分组（小端组内字节逆序显示，BigInt 拼组值），十进制定宽右对齐保列对齐，尾组不足位宽不拼值；每字节保留 data-hx-i 供点击/选区定位，ASCII 列逐字节，0x00 灰显。",
      "tags": ["rendering", "hex-viewer", "performance"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/hex-viewer.js:_hxRenderInspector",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_hxRenderInspector",
      "filePath": "web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "lineRange": [463, 554],
      "summary": "数据检视面板（HxD 特殊编辑器同款）：按选区（多字节选区优先）或光标解释 Binary/Bool/Int8~Int64/ULEB128/SLEB128/Float16/BFloat16/Float32/Float64/RGBA8/Time32/HEX/ASCII，支持大小端切换。",
      "tags": ["inspector", "hex-viewer", "rendering"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/hex-viewer.js:_hxSave",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_hxSave",
      "filePath": "web/js/hex-viewer.js",
      "lineRange": [686, 732],
      "summary": "保存：Intel HEX 模式把镜像回写成 hex 文本（16 字节/行，超 64KB 发 type 04 扩展线性地址记录防地址回绕写坏固件，EOF 记录收尾），普通模式 base64 编码字节经 /api/hex/save 写回；只读模式拒绝保存。",
      "tags": ["persistence", "intel-hex", "serialization"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/sense.js",
